{"id":"n60293-2-8","stage":0,"title":"붙이다 · 挨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60293-2-8-1","ko":"책장은 어디에 놓을까요?","zh":"书架放在哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책장은","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"架设，设置","explanation":"놓다：架设，设置；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"10","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"架设，设置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"在某个地方安装设施、装置或构造物等。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f238a0f92050979ee35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60293-2-8-2","ko":"책상과 붙여서 놓아 주세요.","zh":"请紧挨着书桌放。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상과","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙여서","meaning":"挨，靠，连，贴","explanation":"붙이다：挨，靠，连，贴；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"붙이다","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60293","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓아","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"f50e3cbdb3c8dd13","term":"붙이다","zh":"挨，靠，连，贴","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3","entryId":"60293","definition":"使某物与其他物体相接或使其相互接近。","pronunciation":["부치다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0fa899cc531292174956.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.34,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60293","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":17,"sequenceScore":0.7907,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["书架放在哪里？","请紧挨着书桌放。","周末休息得还好吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["书架放在哪里？","请紧挨着书桌放。","周末休息得还好吗？"],"answer":1}]}
